                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="margin: 0 0 16px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px">各</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px">位老师</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px">：</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px">为进一步引导学生学习方式的变革，培养学生学以致用、综合解决实际问题的能力，绍兴市教育教学研究院决定举行绍兴中小学生研究性学习活动成果评比活动。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">请有意参赛的老师将相关的评比材料于<span style="font-family: 宋体; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);">10月<span style="letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 14px; font-family: "Times New Roman";">20</span>日之前交至教科室</span>。</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">具体</span>事项通知如下：</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px"><span style="font-family:黑体">一、评比项目</span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">小课题研究、调查报告（含综合实践活动成果，高一、二年级生涯规划书，高中模拟政协）、学科小论文</span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 黑体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px">二、评比时间</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px">2022</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">年</span>11<span style="font-family:宋体">月</span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 黑体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px">三、评比要求</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px">2022</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">年</span>9<span style="font-family:宋体">月前结题的个人或小组合作产生的学生成果，已在市级及以上单位举办的活动中获奖的成果不再参加评比。</span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">具体评比要求如下：</span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px">1</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">．参评的成果材料应如实地反映学生在学习过程中，通过多种学习或实践方式取得的成果和真实体验，内容丰富，思路清晰。</span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px">2</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">．成果的作者应是学生。可以是个人成果，也可以是集体成果。集体成果署名不多于</span>5<span style="font-family:宋体">个。指导老师不超过</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2</span><span style="font-family:宋体">个。</span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px">3</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">．成果以文字说明为主，适当配以图片和图示。</span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px">4</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">．成果应简洁明了，注意控制字数。小学、初中</span>3000<span style="font-family:宋体">字以内，高中</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">5000</span><span style="font-family:宋体">字以内。</span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px">5</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">．上报成果时，应将学生所写的文本、相关实物作品照片和实践过程的照片、有关视频等作为附件一起打包递交。</span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px">6</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">．上报的成果请在封面左上角注明类别。如小学</span>—<span style="font-family:宋体">小课题、小学</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">—</span><span style="font-family:宋体">调查报告（综合实践活动）；初中</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">—</span><span style="font-family:宋体">小课题、初中</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">—</span><span style="font-family:宋体">调查报告（综合实践活动）、初中</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">—</span><span style="font-family:宋体">小论文；高中</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">—</span><span style="font-family:宋体">小课题、高中</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">—</span><span style="font-family:宋体">调查报告（综合实践活动、生涯规划书大赛、模拟政协）、高中</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">—</span><span style="font-family:宋体">小论文等。</span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 黑体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px">四、体例格式</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px"><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">（一）总体撰稿要求</span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px">1</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">．封面标明课题名称、研究时间、学校、班级、指导老师（联系方式）、作者或小组成员。</span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px">2</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">．内容正文用小四号宋体，标题用小三号黑体；行间距为固定值</span>22<span style="font-family:宋体">磅。采用</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">Word</span><span style="font-family:宋体">文档，</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">A4</span><span style="font-family:宋体">纸，页边距设置上、下为</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2.54cm,</span><span style="font-family:宋体">左、右为</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2.2cm</span><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px">3</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">．附件是帮助评委了解研究过程的真实性、科学性以及成果的一些原始文字材料，附件总页数一般情况控制在</span>A4<span style="font-family:宋体">纸</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">10</span><span style="font-family:宋体">页以内。</span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px"><span style="font-family:楷体_GB2312">（二）项目具体撰稿要求</span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px">1</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">．研究性学习成果中小课题研究、调查报告撰写步骤：研究（调查）的背景与意义、过程与方法、结果与分析、结论与讨论四个部分。</span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px">2</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">．义教段综合实践活动征集的成果是学校和教师根据教育部</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px">2017</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">年版《中小学综合实践活动课程指导纲要》综合实践活动课程的目标、内容、方式，组织开展课程活动过程中指导学生形成的相关成果。成果应如实地反映学生在某一主题活动中，通过多种实践学习方式（考察探究、设计制作、社会服务、职业体验、场馆学习、队团活动等）取得的学习成果和真实体验记录，内容丰富，思路清晰。以活动报告的形式为主，学生成果报告由题目、摘要、正文、参考文献构成。其中正文包含背景与意义，过程与方法、结果与分析、结论与讨论四个部分。（见附件）</span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px">3</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">．高中生涯规划书大赛，由</span>7<span style="font-family:宋体">月作品的初赛成绩前</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">40%</span><span style="font-family:宋体">将进入</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">10</span><span style="font-family:宋体">月决赛（决赛环节由主题陈述、现场答辩两部分组成，每位选手主题陈述环节限时</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">10</span><span style="font-family:宋体">分钟，现场答辩环节限时</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">5</span><span style="font-family:宋体">分钟）。其主题可以从职业规划或学业规划两个角度切入，内容既要有可操作性，同时能够反映当代中学生积极进取的精神风貌，题目自拟（见附件）。</span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px">4</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">．模拟政协报告内容主要包括四个部分：研究背景、存在问题、原因分析和对策建议（格式见附件，其他要求另见通知）。</span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 黑体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px">五、报送数量及要求</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px">1</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">．区、县（市）报送上限</span></span></p><table width="459"><tbody><tr style="height:18px" class="firstRow"><td width="55" valign="center" rowspan="2" style="padding: 0px 6px; border-width: 2px 1px 1px 2px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'">区、县（市）</span></strong></p></td><td width="135" valign="center" colspan="3" style="padding: 0px 6px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top-width: 2px; border-top-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:0;text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-fa