table><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px">2<span style="font-family:宋体">．报送截止时间：</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2022</span><span style="font-family:宋体">年</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">10</span><span style="font-family:宋体">月底。其中高中生涯规划书每所学校最多报送</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2</span><span style="font-family:宋体">份，每位教师最多报送</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">份，请于</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">6</span><span style="font-family:宋体">月</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">10</span><span style="font-family:宋体">号前由各区、县（市）生涯规划负责人上报相关教研员。高中模拟政协单独组织实施与评比。</span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px">3<span style="font-family:宋体">．参评的成果材料以文字报告（包括有关图片）的纸质稿和电子稿两种形式同时报送。其中，纸质一式四份（其中</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">3</span><span style="font-family:宋体">份不出现单位名称、作者和指导教师姓名等相关信息）；报告、附件、承诺书、汇总表电子稿各一份，由各区、县（市）教研室在评比的基础上，统一报送我院各项目联络人（见附件）。</span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px">4<span style="font-family:宋体">．请各区、县（市）教研室、教师发展中心（教育研究中心）认真组织，落实专人负责完成，逾期视自动放弃。</span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 黑体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 17px">六、评比规定</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px">1</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">．本次评比按参评成果篇目总数的</span>80%<span style="font-family:宋体">取奖，以</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">2:3:5</span><span style="font-family:宋体">的比例设一、二、三等奖；获一等奖成果的指导教师同时获市优秀指导教师奖。</span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 宋体;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px">2</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 14px"><span style="font-family:宋体">．本次评比的评委由我院统一聘请。</span></span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px">附件：</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px">．</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px">2022</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px">年绍兴市中小学生研究性学习活动成果评比联络人</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px">2</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px">．</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px">2022</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px">年绍兴市中小学生研究性学习活动成果评比推荐目录</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px">3</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px">．</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px">2022</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px">年绍兴市中小学生研究性学习活动成果评比承诺书</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px">4</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px">．</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px">2021</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px">年绍兴市中小学生综合实践活动成果评比推荐目录</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:16px;margin-left:0;text-indent:34px;padding:0 0 0 0 ;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:32px"><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px">5</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px">．绍兴市</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px">2022</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px">年中小学生综合实践活动成果评比承诺书</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-height: 32px"><span style="font-family: 微软雅黑;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px">6</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px">．</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px">2022</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 13px">年绍兴市高中生涯规划书作品汇总表、申报书、参考模板</span></p><p style="margin: 0 0 16px;text-indent: 34px;padding: 0;line-hei